  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equilibrium of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> give</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>mg</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>&nbsp;= Tension in string)<br /><br />Net torque about point of contact of the spool should be<br />zero. Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>Mgsinα</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>TR</mi></math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>Mgsinα</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>mg</mi></math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Msinα</mi></math></p>",
